&lt;p>I was unsatisfied with the brake and turn signal combos available online, so I made my own. It has running lights, brake
lights, turn signals, and license plate illumination. I used high output LEDs and used the extra space on the PCB for
heat sinking.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>If you&amp;rsquo;re curious about the bike, it&amp;rsquo;s a 1983 Kawasaki CSR 305. Here&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a href="motorcycle-brake-and-turn-light-04.jpg">a picture of it&lt;/a> next to the
Mississippi River.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>MFRC522 RFID Reader and Writer</title><link>https://pcbisolation.com/projects/mfrc522-rfid-reader-and-writer/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Mar 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pcbisolation.com/projects/mfrc522-rfid-reader-and-writer/</guid><description>&lt;div class="figure-gallery"
